  "about_privacy_heading": "Privacy",
  "about_privacy_no_data": "Fretboard Master collects no personal data: no account, no sign-up, no email, no name, no identifier.",
  "about_privacy_stored": "Your settings stay only in this browser on this device: language and notation; instrument; sound, volume and tempo; theme; labels, last tool; hints shown; shortcuts switch; and metronome settings. No cookies are used.",
  "about_privacy_erase": "Clearing browser data, or Erase my preferences below, removes them. If storage is blocked, the app still works.",
  "about_privacy_measured": "The app sends anonymous counts to its own site: tool opened, first fretboard tap, sound played, link shared, link opened, instrument changed. Each carries only tool, device type, language and instrument (strings, tuning, left-handed).",
  "about_privacy_errors": "If something breaks, an anonymous report with the view settings and instrument is sent.",
  "about_privacy_never": "Never sent: identifiers, link addresses or custom tuning notes. Nothing is used for profiles, ads, cross-referencing or other companies.",
  "about_privacy_dnt": "With Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control on, nothing is sent.",
  "about_privacy_no_ads": "There are no ads, no trackers and no content from other companies.",
  "about_privacy_no_permissions": "The app never asks for your microphone, camera, location or notifications.",
  "about_privacy_hosting": "The service delivering the app sees what any website sees, such as your IP address, only to deliver it.",
  "about_privacy_share_links": "A share link holds only view settings, no personal data, and goes only to whoever you send it to.",
  "about_privacy_all_ages": "It suits all ages: no contact between users and no content from users.",
